{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05744","headline":"奉和圣制次琼岳应制 · 李林甫","name":"奉和圣制次琼岳应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东幸从人望，西巡顺物回。\n云收二华出，天转五星来。\n十月农初罢，三驱礼复开。\n更看琼岳上，佳气接神台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李林甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}